  "details": "1. Be not in the same instance with the profile you check.\n\n2. Open Profile in MM\n\nIt shows the account as \"User\" while it's actually a \"New User\". Joining the person adjusts it to \"New User\" rank. Leaving the instance causes it to show \"User\" again. From my observation everyone gets shown as 1 rank higher (friends and non friends)",
